om/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=I%20saw%20what%20that,trick%20with%20the%20candles.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e11","era":null,"summary":"Merret weaves a nightmare in Wothis's mind but loses focus when Wothis nears Soche, and Wothis seizes the baby.","participants":["merret","grimbly-wothis","soche","merret-s-baby"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":603,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":55,"quote":"And like that, my baby is in Grimbly Wothis's arms","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=And%20like%20that%2C%20my,in%20Grimbly%20Wothis%27s%20arms","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=And%20like%20that%2C%20my,in%20Grimbly%20Wothis%27s%20arms","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e12","era":null,"summary":"Wothis kicks Merret in the mouth and throws Tashi into a cabinet, breaking her ribs.","participants":["grimbly-wothis","merret","tashi"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":603,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":58,"quote":"With a hard shake, he flings her off.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cov