=Any%20outstanding%20debts%20Merret,close%20of%20business%20tomorrow","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e16","era":null,"summary":"Lazav offers to pay Merret's debts, give a stipend, and send a tutor to teach the gifted baby, who stays with the family.","participants":["lazav","merret","merret-s-baby","house-dimir"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":603,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":75,"quote":"we would like to ask that we send a tutor to your home to oversee his learning","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=we%20would%20like%20to,to%20oversee%20his%20learning","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Under the Cover of Fog","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-10-10","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=we%20would%20like%20to,to%20oversee%20his%20learning","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Under the Cover of Fog\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 10 Oct 2018."}},{"id":"under-cover-fog-2018-10-10-e17","era":null,"summary":"Lazav's laugh scrambles the family's memories so that Great Aunt Bea seems to be staying with them.","participants":["lazav","merret","tashi","soche","great-aunt-bea"],"location":"keyhole-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10","order":603,"story_date":"2018-10-10","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":78,"quote":"Lazav laughs a raspy laugh, like stones scratching against rib bone.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/under-cover-fog-2018-10-10#:~:text=Lazav%20laug